{{#> layout title="Reset your password" preheader=(concat "Choose a new password. The link lasts " expirationMinutes " minutes.") reason="because a password reset was asked for on this account"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0;">Someone asked to reset the password for the {{appName}} account at <strong>{{email}}</strong>. Press the button to choose a new one.</p>
{{> button url=resetUrl label="Choose a new password"}}
{{> fallback url=resetUrl}}
{{#> note}}The link works once and lasts <strong>{{expirationMinutes}} minutes</strong>. Never share it.{{/note}}
{{#> warn}}<strong>Did not ask for this?</strong> Ignore this email and your password stays as it is.{{/warn}}
{{/layout}}
